OL,3,GNEWSAPadel court complex approved for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a padel court complex at a
OL,7,Fretail park have been approved for the
OL,8,Fsecond time, after developers scaled
OL,9,Fback the scheme.
OL,11,FSunderland City Council originally gave
OL,12,Fpermission for the nine-court facility
OL,13,Fearlier this year at Peel Retail Park
OL,14,Fin Washington, however, the operator,
OL,15,FSoul Padel Ltd had to re-submit the
OL,16,Fplans due to underground utilities
OL,17,Frunning across the area.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
