OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPadel court complex approved for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme has been reduced from nine
OL,7,Fpadel courts to seven and will include
OL,8,Fadditional parking, while plans for a
OL,9,Fclubhouse, toilets, coffee bar and
OL,10,Fseating area remain unchanged.
OL,12,FThe council said the new design was
OL,13,F"good quality" and acceptable in size
OL,14,Fand scale.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
